peka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.63.100","text":"(b) Individuals wanting a master’s license for factory-built solid fuel or gas fireplace hearth appliances shall have passed both an approved fireplace hearth certification exam and a gas hearth appliance certification exam. Only those examinations developed by an independent, nationally recognized testing or educational institution and approved by the Development Services Director will be accepted.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c5fe44ef-1fdc-5cca-8e6c-1dba610e6bdd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.63.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.63.100","content_hash":"8e60125fcaed11711e5886b3e9ac0ea5feb7eb81b918611e0b5d1397694fd203","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.63.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.63.100:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.63.100","text":"(c) Individuals wanting a sheet metal journeyman’s license shall make application for that subcategory exam as given by an independent, nationally recognized testing agency approved by the Development Services Director. (Ord. 19330 § 29, 11-3-09. Code 1995 § 30-529.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e23fa038-3b5b-52ad-8314-d04e4bce0997"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.63.100:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}